								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Your workday. Their adventure.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >A little dwarven forge. A growing armory. One more reason to glance at your taskbar.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Taskbar Armory is a cozy incremental idle game that settles above your Windows taskbar. Your dwarves mine, forge and sell while you work, browse or take a break. Check in for an upgrade, admire your newest creation, then let the hammers keep swinging.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/097a7deb69c0a770efa284f6db64018c.poster.avif?t=1793339650" width=780 height=162 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/097a7deb69c0a770efa284f6db64018c.webm?t=1793339650" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/097a7deb69c0a770efa284f6db64018c.mp4?t=1793339650" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Mine. Forge. Sell. Grow.</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Build your production line</strong> — Turn ore into bars, weapons and coins. </p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Upgrade your workshop</strong> — Grow your Mine, Forge, Anvil and Shop, and trigger boosts for a burst of production. </p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Let the forge look after itself</strong> — Unlock Auto Boost, repeat expeditions and automatic reward collection through play.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/2292c43bc436e61e15743b096834d59f.poster.avif?t=1793339650" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/2292c43bc436e61e15743b096834d59f.webm?t=1793339650" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/2292c43bc436e61e15743b096834d59f.mp4?t=1793339650" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >Build an armory worth admiring</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Collect 96 equipment designs</strong> — Discover 12 equipment families across eight tiers, from humble iron to brilliant fantasy treasures.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Craft your favorites</strong> — Choose your designs, master them and display your proudest creations in the forge.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Explore the Showcase</strong> — Browse your collection and uncover the stories behind your weapons.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/8e4a325e20f939e636880020a4acfe83.poster.avif?t=1793339650" width=780 height=202 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/8e4a325e20f939e636880020a4acfe83.webm?t=1793339650" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5226040/extras/8e4a325e20f939e636880020a4acfe83.mp4?t=1793339650" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Adventures beyond the anvil</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Send heroes through the portal </strong>— Launch timed dungeon expeditions for coins, gems, relics and rare loot. </p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Make every discovery count</strong> — Invest your rewards in gem upgrades and the Relic Armory.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Reforge something greater</strong> — Restart your workshop for lasting bonuses while keeping your collection, decorations, gems, relics and permanent upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Make yourself at home</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Decorate your forge</strong> — Earn six decorations and six character looks through relaxed commissions. Arrange your ornaments and customize your expedition parties.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Play without a deadline</strong> — Commissions have no time limits, and switching requests keeps your progress.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Fit the forge around your day</strong> — Choose your monitor and floating, docked or reserved desktop placement. Expand the upgrade drawer when you need it, then tuck it away.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Settle into the soundtrack</strong> — Enjoy 16 tracks, separate music and sound-effect controls, and handy mute, previous-song and next-song shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Come back to progress</strong> — Collect up to eight hours of offline gains, expandable through in-game upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Free to play. Yours to enjoy.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >All gameplay, automation and equipment collecting are free. The optional Supporter Pack adds cosmetic extras and four desktop wallpapers for players who want to support the forge.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Fire up the forge. Make yourself at home.</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
